WEBVTT

00:17:28.195 --> 00:17:30.893
is we need a plan.

00:17:30.893 --> 00:17:32.167
HH: So elaborate.

00:17:32.167 --> 00:17:36.633
JD: Well, I think what we have today
are goals, not a plan.

00:17:36.633 --> 00:17:38.267
And I think a plan

00:17:38.267 --> 00:17:44.927
would be a set of 20 focused
precision policy efforts,

00:17:44.927 --> 00:17:48.517
each of whom's targeted
at the right decision-maker or makers,

00:17:48.517 --> 00:17:52.523
in the right venues,
for these 20 largest nations,

00:17:52.523 --> 00:17:54.743
in the four sectors of their economy.

00:17:54.743 --> 00:17:58.550
And these precision campaigns
would be well-funded,

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.677
they'd be well-focused,

00:17:59.677 --> 00:18:02.757
they'd have an awesome founder/CEO/leader,